### Steps to reproduce

1. Turn on voiceover (macOS).
2. Ctrl + option + command + T should navigate to the next Table.

### Expected results

Ctrl + option + command + T brings the Table into view.

### Actual results

Ctrl + option + command + T announces "Table not found".

### Other details

Using Ctrl + option + U and navigating using the "Tables" menu allows us to bring the Table into view. Table is in the semantics tree.

